 "notes": "Method/demonstration paper: the 'processing' is local VUV irradiation through the STM junction; the property is of the junction (computed field enhancement), so PRC->PRP->MEC->STR ordering departs from the canonical spine (property of the tool causes the structure of the workpiece). Experimental Dz (relative) and computed d (absolute) are linked only by the assumed d=0.7 nm at Dz=-7 A. Audit o11: F3d calculated apex shift ds (27-66 A) is far larger than measured ds (2-20 A) in F3c, against the text's claim that offsets are reproduced; F3b theory panel itself shows only a few-A offset, so F3d right axis may be mislabelled. Spot areas come from circumscribed ellipses (F3b), which likely overstate the dehydrogenated area. Information lost: tip-radius dependence (R=10/20/40 nm) and the incidence geometry details.",
 "migrated_from": "r04/graphs/Nano_Letters__10.1021_nl101246z.json"
}